<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1B2B', padding: '28px 72px', position: 'relative', overflow: 'hidden' }}>
    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 0, bottom: 0, opacity: 0.09 }}>
        <svg width='200' height='200' viewBox='0 0 200 200'>
            <circle cx='200' cy='0' r='196' fill='none' stroke='#2E7FE0' strokeWidth='2' />
            <circle cx='200' cy='0' r='150' fill='none' stroke='#2E7FE0' strokeWidth='1.5' />
            <circle cx='200' cy='0' r='104' fill='none' stroke='#48C9B0' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        </svg>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 38, background: '#2E7FE0' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 38, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF6', letterSpacing: 1 }}>从像素到毫米：误差在标定阶段就被消掉</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 524, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 34 }}>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, padding: '24px 24px', background: 'rgba(18,41,63,0.72)', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,246,0.10)', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF6' }}>九点标定：把图像坐标对齐到产线坐标系</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, marginTop: 18, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7FB4EE', letterSpacing: 1 }}>像素平面 / Pixel</Text>
                        <Box style={{ marginTop: 8 }}>
                             <svg width='258' height='258' viewBox='0 0 270 270'>
                                <rect x='10' y='10' width='250' height='250' rx='8' fill='rgba(46,127,224,0.07)' stroke='rgba(46,127,224,0.45)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='93' y1='10' x2='93' y2='260' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='176' y1='10' x2='176' y2='260' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='10' y1='93' x2='260' y2='93' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='10' y1='176' x2='260' y2='176' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <circle cx='52' cy='52' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                                <circle cx='135' cy='52' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                                <circle cx='218' cy='52' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                                <circle cx='52' cy='135' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                                <circle cx='135' cy='135' r='7' fill='#F2B33D' />
                                <circle cx='218' cy='135' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                                <circle cx='52' cy='218' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                                <circle cx='135' cy='218' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                                <circle cx='218' cy='218' r='7' fill='#2E7FE0' />
                            </svg>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ width: 44, justifyContent: 'center', paddingTop: 100 }}>
                        <svg width='44' height='30' viewBox='0 0 44 30'>
                            <path d='M2 15 L34 15' stroke='#F2B33D' strokeWidth='2' />
                            <path d='M30 8 L42 15 L30 22 Z' fill='#F2B33D' />
                        </svg>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8FA9C4', textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 8 }}>标定</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7FDDC7', letterSpacing: 1 }}>世界坐标 / mm</Text>
                        <Box style={{ marginTop: 8 }}>
                             <svg width='258' height='258' viewBox='0 0 270 270'>
                                <rect x='10' y='10' width='250' height='250' rx='8' fill='rgba(72,201,176,0.07)' stroke='rgba(72,201,176,0.45)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='93' y1='10' x2='93' y2='260' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='176' y1='10' x2='176' y2='260' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='10' y1='93' x2='260' y2='93' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <line x1='10' y1='176' x2='260' y2='176' stroke='rgba(232,238,246,0.10)' strokeWidth='1' />
                                <circle cx='52' cy='52' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                                <circle cx='135' cy='52' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                                <circle cx='218' cy='52' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                                <circle cx='52' cy='135' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                                <circle cx='135' cy='135' r='7' fill='#F2B33D' />
                                <circle cx='218' cy='135' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                                <circle cx='52' cy='218' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                                <circle cx='135' cy='218' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                                <circle cx='218' cy='218' r='7' fill='#48C9B0' />
                            </svg>
                        </Box>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', borderRadius: 8, background: 'rgba(46,127,224,0.12)', borderLeft: '3px solid #2E7FE0' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#C6D6E6', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                    标定之后，"绑定"绑的不只是码和物，还有它们在真实空间里的位置。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 460, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF6' }}>绑定发生在标定之后</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8FA9C4', lineHeight: 1.9, marginTop: 14 }}>
                    九点标定用棋盘或圆点靶标确定原点与 X、Y 方向，把像素坐标换算成毫米级世界坐标；检测结果与条码结果按同帧绑成一条记录，并带编码器值。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Image src='assets/data-page.png' style={{ width: 460, height: 270, objectFit: 'contain', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,246,0.12)' }} />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10 }}>
                {['X / Y 世界坐标', '旋转角', '当帧编码器值'].map((t, i) => (
                    <Box key={i} style={{ padding: '7px 14px', borderRadius: 999, border: '1px solid rgba(72,201,176,0.45)', background: 'rgba(72,201,176,0.10)' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7FDDC7' }}>{t}</Text>
                    </Box>
                ))}
            </Box>
        </Box>

    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A6480', letterSpacing: 1 }}>CAV 物码绑定视觉系统</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A6480' }}>09 / 16</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
